{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39731","headline":"贺清源仆射新命 · 黄滔","name":"贺清源仆射新命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽言嵩岳秀崔嵬，少降连枝命世才。\n南史两荣唯百揆，东闽双拜有三台。\n二天在顶家家咏，丹凤衔书岁岁来。\n虚说古贤龙虎盛，谁攀荆树上金台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}